1120.text:
The Safe account will need to have a signer to sign user operations. In permissionless.js, the default Safe account validates ECDSA signatures. Any permissionless.js-compatible signer can be used for the Safe account.For example, to create a signer based on a private key:import { privateKeyToAccount, toAccount } from &quot;viem/accounts&quot;
