Since we may not have access to all the signers at once, we should prepare a user operation and then submit it later after all the signers have signed.const unSignedUserOperation = await smartAccountClient.prepareUserOperation({
	calls: [
		{
			to: &quot;0xd8da6bf26964af9d7eed9e03e53415d37aa96045&quot;,
			value: parseEther(&quot;0.1&quot;),
